SUMMARY:Marvelous Moths
DESCRIPTION:Did you know that there are over 3000 species of moths in North Carolina?  Join ecoEXPLORE Central to learn about these amazing\, diverse insects\, including why they come to lights at night\, how they eat (or not!)\, and the variety of moths that call our state home. \nRegister
